<title>SWEDEN: Average rate 4.53 pct on Swedish 11-month T-bill.</title>
<headline>Average rate 4.53 pct on Swedish 11-month T-bill.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>The average accepted rate in an oversubscribed auction of 11-month Treasury bills was 4.534 percent, Sweden's National Debt Office said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The office had invited bids for a total of 7.0 billion crowns. It received bids for 16 billion crowns, and allocated 7.0 billion.</p>
<p>-- Stockholm newsroom +46-8-700-1017</p>
